The local LeRobot copy has been reduced to the camera configuration, motor bus,
Feetech, SO follower, keyboard teleoperator, and supporting utility modules needed
by this repository. Torch-coupled policy, processor, dataset, training, simulation,
and visualization code is not included. Some type-only imports and utility files
were reduced to remove dependencies that are not used by the hardware controller.

